_paragraph\" >Team up in multiplayer to share resources and defend your base, or test your skills solo. Drive vehicles, hunt, complete quests, and shape your own path in a world that never forgives mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player and multiplayer survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Base building and crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic weather and day/night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mission and quest system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Farming, hunting and resource gathering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Driving and combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expansive open world full of danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/215effeb9e44caec6b8e51e641f0deef.avif?t=1764922174\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["BadBit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/4500acb91039190bad0fe34a2f32d7a99ce888c9/header.jpg?t=1764922174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1772910/486009/380d57a188de6d711b0127f525ce52c624645a9f/1751029482/dash_av1.mpd?t=1659961147","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.